      "value": "Not sure if it's related, but I've been having weird \"humping\" or leg/hip spazzing behavior in some worlds, as seen in this video:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7AwJApNlzH8\nAlso, possible duplicate? Is it related?\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-30/p/bug-grounded-parameter-unstable-on-30-avatars",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
