      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b7c3929d5fc6b20af6b960a|full_name}: Related. The \"Grounded\" value rapidly switching between True and False is what causes the issue, but it only happens when you're standing on specific surfaces.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
